    "turn_idx": 3,
    "turn_text": "I'm really excited too, Maryam. Congresswoman Clark has been a leading light in the legislature on issues of AI and on bias amongst many other things, including cities and beyond. And so for me, this is just a real treat to be able to hear directly from her about her vision for how we can do a better job on making sure that AI is ethical and serves all in society.",
