    "turn_text": "Thank you, Congresswoman, and we're certainly very excited about the Algorithmic Accountability Act and every piece of it that you just mentioned seems to me to be really critical as a first step. As you say, of course, it's not everything. And so I wanted to ask you, you know, what else do we need to see? There's, you know, I think a role for legislation and you're leading the charge on that. You mentioned just now some voluntary action at the company level. We have a new administration, of course, as well. And, you know, we'd be curious for your thoughts on what can be done at that level from an executive point of view. What would you like to see as early priorities for the new administration?",
