    "turn_text": "Absolutely. What an incredible vision that the Congresswoman outlined for us. So many important points that she made. For me, what really jumped out is just her way of connecting what we're seeing in the technology world with the broader social developments and issues that are playing out in American society and really just highlighting the stakes of this work that she's doing and of the legislation that she's working on. I'm curious, man, anything that jumped out to you?",
