    "turn_idx": 28,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. And I think one thing that we've heard from several of our guests and read about for several years now is that one of the solutions to those issues is to actually have a more diverse workforce in the AI industry. And so it's really impressed and inspired by the Commerce Women's comments about how young people can get involved in this space and how we can nurture a more diverse forward facing workforce, and I just found those comments about future generations really changing how this industry operates to be really just very inspiring.",
