    "turn_idx": 29,
    "turn_text": "No question, it was a call to action and a role for each of us to play in ensuring that technology is embedded with the best of our values in America and that we reduce the harms that we're perpetuating, which again, each of us from the youth, I'm glad she included us non-youth to each of our different perspectives ethnicities, races are necessary to include so that in the way that US has benefited historically from So many different cultures and perspectives our technology can benefit as well.",
