  {
    "episode_id": 74292,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/4/74292.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 30,
    "turn_text": "Absolutely. Well, I think the last thing I'll say is, you know, I think we're in a place with AI technology where we are moving from the kind of early days, the Wild West to a time when there is going to be more legislation, there is going to be more regulation. And I'm just very happy to have Congresswoman Clark leading the charge in the US because she is just such a thoughtful educated and passionate thinker on this.",
